{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25804","headline":"过梅里七首  家於无锡四十载今敝庐数堵犹存今列题於後 忆西湖双鸂鶒 · 李绅","name":"过梅里七首  家於无锡四十载今敝庐数堵犹存今列题於後 忆西湖双鸂鶒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双鸂鶒，锦毛斓斑长比翼，戏绕莲藂回锦臆。\n照灼花丛两相得，渔歌惊起飞南北。\n缭绕追随不迷惑，云间上下同栖息。\n不作惊禽远相忆，东家少妇机中语。\n剪断回文泣机杼，徒嗟孔雀衔毛羽。\n一去东南别离苦，五里裴回竟何补。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}